(6694972, 1001464, 101256, '<td valign="top">A closer look at the heron would have improved this but only a little - the detail, even at a distance, is sharp and viewable. Like the concept, like the title and like the tonality of the picture.  Nicely done.</td>', 'A closer look at the heron would have improved this but only a little - the detail, even at a distance, is sharp and viewable. Like the concept, like the title and like the tonality of the picture.  Nicely done.', '2012-02-29 08:19:55.000000', NULL, 1),
