(6694975, 1000699, 101256, '<td valign="top">Interesting choice of euphemism and imagery.  I like it - clever. Different take on the phrase which is used mostly in education. Can''t pick one part of the image to critique - very unique.  Well done.</td>', 'Interesting choice of euphemism and imagery.  I like it - clever. Different take on the phrase which is used mostly in education. Can''t pick one part of the image to critique - very unique.  Well done.', '2012-02-29 08:22:49.000000', NULL, 1),
