(6694977, 1000503, 132251, '<td valign="top">I am sure you know this, but it seems her top half is overexposed while the bottom is under. There are a lot of washed out areas, which is a shame because it is a really nice composition. <br/>(I''m guessing they do match, once she takes the wig off)</td>', 'I am sure you know this, but it seems her top half is overexposed while the bottom is under. There are a lot of washed out areas, which is a shame because it is a really nice composition. (I''m guessing they do match, once she takes the wig off)', '2012-02-29 08:24:14.000000', NULL, 1),
