(6694988, 1000975, 15711, '<td valign="top">Yours is by far the stand out for this euphemism.  Love the composition, contrasts and tones.  Actually my fav so far. 8</td>', 'Yours is by far the stand out for this euphemism.  Love the composition, contrasts and tones.  Actually my fav so far. 8', '2012-02-29 08:30:33.000000', NULL, 1),
