(6694995, 1000828, 132251, '<td valign="top">She looks like a fun time...</td>', 'She looks like a fun time...', '2012-02-29 08:38:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6695029, 1001395, 134859, '<td valign="top">Love this.  The selective saturation/desaturation works wonderfully in this photo.  It gives it that "pop" of color, while tying in the euphemism.  The focus on the daisies, while blurring the background creates the eye to focus even more so on the flowers.  Great shot!</td>', 'Love this.  The selective saturation/desaturation works wonderfully in this photo.  It gives it that "pop" of color, while tying in the euphemism.  The focus on the daisies, while blurring the background creates the eye to focus even more so on the flowers.  Great shot!', '2012-02-29 09:49:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6695033, 1001313, 134859, '<td valign="top">Beautiful.  Love the colors.  The rusty colors of the boat and grass against the vibrant sky is lovely.  The sharpness and detail is there.  One of my favorites!  10</td>', 'Beautiful.  Love the colors.  The rusty colors of the boat and grass against the vibrant sky is lovely.  The sharpness and detail is there.  One of my favorites!  10', '2012-02-29 09:50:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6695036, 1001385, 134859, '<td valign="top">Great shot.  The photo perfectly depicts what the euphemism suggests.  Lovely black and white.</td>', 'Great shot.  The photo perfectly depicts what the euphemism suggests.  Lovely black and white.', '2012-02-29 09:52:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6695042, 1000503, 134859, '<td valign="top">I like the euphemism here.  The platinum colored hair does suggest that the "carpet does not match the drapes".  The face and pearls seem a little overexposed, which left harsh tones on other parts of the skin.  I would to have liked to see a softer overall skin tone (a slight glassiaun blur would have worked well here.</td>', 'I like the euphemism here.  The platinum colored hair does suggest that the "carpet does not match the drapes".  The face and pearls seem a little overexposed, which left harsh tones on other parts of the skin.  I would to have liked to see a softer overall skin tone (a slight glassiaun blur would have worked well here.', '2012-02-29 09:56:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6695045, 1001440, 134859, '<td valign="top">Love the euphemism choice.  I think the noose was a touch out of focus, would have liked to have seen a little more detail/sharpness to it.  But it works well agains the blurred background.  The color conversion is a nice choice as well.  Good shot.</td>', 'Love the euphemism choice.  I think the noose was a touch out of focus, would have liked to have seen a little more detail/sharpness to it.  But it works well agains the blurred background.  The color conversion is a nice choice as well.  Good shot.', '2012-02-29 09:57:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6695056, 1001574, 134859, '<td valign="top">Gross!  LOL.  <br/>Other than the obvious reason for disgust, I like this shot a lot.  The tilt and lens distortion works great... almost makes you feel like you''ve been drinking.  Not quite sure about the picture on the floor, kind of takes away from the photo.  But the lighting works, the colors are nicely shot, and the image definitely fits the title.  Great job.  8</td>', 'Gross!  LOL.  Other than the obvious reason for disgust, I like this shot a lot.  The tilt and lens distortion works great... almost makes you feel like you''ve been drinking.  Not quite sure about the picture on the floor, kind of takes away from the photo.  But the lighting works, the colors are nicely shot, and the image definitely fits the title.  Great job.  8', '2012-02-29 10:03:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6695057, 1001018, 134859, '<td valign="top">I''d say it is most certainly a "fixer upper".  Love the overall feel of the photo.  The over processing works well.  Do have a question, in the top left of the photo, is that an "orb" that appeared in the picture?  If so, you know some people believe that those are actually ghosts/spirits caught on camera?  Thought it was interesting to see and point out.  <br/> <br/>Also, I especially like the handle in the bottom right of the image.  It''s one of the first things I noticed.  Great shot!</td>', 'I''d say it is most certainly a "fixer upper".  Love the overall feel of the photo.  The over processing works well.  Do have a question, in the top left of the photo, is that an "orb" that appeared in the picture?  If so, you know some people believe that those are actually ghosts/spirits caught on camera?  Thought it was interesting to see and point out.   Also, I especially like the handle in the bottom right of the image.  It''s one of the first things I noticed.  Great shot!', '2012-02-29 10:06:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6695061, 1001420, 134859, '<td valign="top">This is a wonderful idea.  I like the lone peeled egg.  If you had used normal white eggs, the effect wouldn''t have been nearly as prominent.  The focus is right on, and the simplistic nature of the shot is well executed.  Great job</td>', 'This is a wonderful idea.  I like the lone peeled egg.  If you had used normal white eggs, the effect wouldn''t have been nearly as prominent.  The focus is right on, and the simplistic nature of the shot is well executed.  Great job', '2012-02-29 10:07:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6695062, 1000538, 134859, '<td valign="top">Very cool take on things.  I was actually going to use this same Euphemism; as there is a tunnel that I have wanted to shoot since driving through... but since it''s about two and a half hours from our home, I don''t think my hubby would have appreciated the gas used for one shot.  lol.  <br/> <br/>I like this.  It''s simple, it''s interesting... 9</td>', 'Very cool take on things.  I was actually going to use this same Euphemism; as there is a tunnel that I have wanted to shoot since driving through... but since it''s about two and a half hours from our home, I don''t think my hubby would have appreciated the gas used for one shot.  lol.   I like this.  It''s simple, it''s interesting... 9', '2012-02-29 10:09:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6695064, 1001148, 101256, '<td valign="top">I think this would have worked better in black and white.  There is a fine grain to the image that would have given the subject a lot more impact.</td>', 'I think this would have worked better in black and white.  There is a fine grain to the image that would have given the subject a lot more impact.', '2012-02-29 10:10:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6695065, 1001360, 134859, '<td valign="top">WONDERFUL SHOT!  I was wondering if someone was going to choose this euphemism.  You did great shooting this one, the action is great... the actual nut coming at you (no pun intended) is well shot (another pun not intended, lol).</td>', 'WONDERFUL SHOT!  I was wondering if someone was going to choose this euphemism.  You did great shooting this one, the action is great... the actual nut coming at you (no pun intended) is well shot (another pun not intended, lol).', '2012-02-29 10:10:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6695067, 1001007, 134859, '<td valign="top">I''d say she wasn''t in her youth anymore.  Fitting title.  Love the black and white conversion.  And the sunlight hitting the back of her hair, lighting it up makes it seem even more messy.  I like it.</td>', 'I''d say she wasn''t in her youth anymore.  Fitting title.  Love the black and white conversion.  And the sunlight hitting the back of her hair, lighting it up makes it seem even more messy.  I like it.', '2012-02-29 10:11:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6695071, 1001464, 134859, '<td valign="top">Love this shot.  The earth tone colors, the DOF, the extra sharp appearance.  Wonderful job.  Also, the glimpse of the creek is one of the things that really stand out, making the picture that much better.  Without it, "up the creek" wouldn''t have been AS fitting.  But it''s a perfect euphemism for this shot.  Beautiful!  9</td>', 'Love this shot.  The earth tone colors, the DOF, the extra sharp appearance.  Wonderful job.  Also, the glimpse of the creek is one of the things that really stand out, making the picture that much better.  Without it, "up the creek" wouldn''t have been AS fitting.  But it''s a perfect euphemism for this shot.  Beautiful!  9', '2012-02-29 10:13:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6695072, 1000845, 101256, '<td valign="top">I like it - the initial impression over comes the little minor flaws that one could nit pick to death. Just as an observation, not being critical, a little more open aperture would have lightened up the dark edges.  Then again, the lighter slightly off center subject works well in contrast with the darker parts.  Six of one, half dozen of the other.</td>', 'I like it - the initial impression over comes the little minor flaws that one could nit pick to death. Just as an observation, not being critical, a little more open aperture would have lightened up the dark edges.  Then again, the lighter slightly off center subject works well in contrast with the darker parts.  Six of one, half dozen of the other.', '2012-02-29 10:13:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6695073, 1000959, 134859, '<td valign="top">That''s an awesome reflection here!  The red and blue lights in the back of the picture are where my attention was drawn first (so I think that actually takes away from the picture) but then I noticed the rest of the picture.  Beautifully done.  It''s a nice shot</td>', 'That''s an awesome reflection here!  The red and blue lights in the back of the picture are where my attention was drawn first (so I think that actually takes away from the picture) but then I noticed the rest of the picture.  Beautifully done.  It''s a nice shot', '2012-02-29 10:15:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6695074, 1001463, 134859, '<td valign="top">WOW.  That''s the first thing that came to mind.  It''s beautiful.  The colors work perfect.  The Euphemism fits, the lighting is perfect.  The sharpness and detail make it really stand out.  Love it!  9</td>', 'WOW.  That''s the first thing that came to mind.  It''s beautiful.  The colors work perfect.  The Euphemism fits, the lighting is perfect.  The sharpness and detail make it really stand out.  Love it!  9', '2012-02-29 10:16:43.000000', NULL, 1),
