(6695088, 1001018, 101256, '<td valign="top">Like the way the light blends from right to left.  Nice composition of square and angle. Highly detailed and it matches the title perfectly.  Well done.</td>', 'Like the way the light blends from right to left.  Nice composition of square and angle. Highly detailed and it matches the title perfectly.  Well done.', '2012-02-29 10:24:07.000000', NULL, 1),
