(6695091, 1001207, 134859, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous shot.  I''m always a fan of landscapes, and the mist/fog in this one is wonderful.  The colors of the sunset (or sunrise?) are beautiful.  The darkness contrasts perfectly.  Love it!</td>', 'Gorgeous shot.  I''m always a fan of landscapes, and the mist/fog in this one is wonderful.  The colors of the sunset (or sunrise?) are beautiful.  The darkness contrasts perfectly.  Love it!', '2012-02-29 10:25:57.000000', NULL, 1),
