(6695113, 1000975, 101256, '<td valign="top">Oh man - this is just outstanding.  Not only is it composed perfectly, the image itself is technically flawless. Another one of the top ten images if not the overall winner - there is some tough competition in this challenge and I''m only about twenty images in so far.  Very nicely done.  Perfect.</td>', 'Oh man - this is just outstanding.  Not only is it composed perfectly, the image itself is technically flawless. Another one of the top ten images if not the overall winner - there is some tough competition in this challenge and I''m only about twenty images in so far.  Very nicely done.  Perfect.', '2012-02-29 10:39:42.000000', NULL, 1),
