(6695164, 1001535, 101256, '<td valign="top">I''m not a big fan of HDR, but this works for me. There is a metallic quality to this image that reminds me of some artists who attempt photo realistic images with paints, chalk, etc. I don''t think the image is quite up to the same level as some others, but it is an interesting image. There are a few minor technical issues like color changes along the arm pit and under the chin, but other than that - not much to complain about.</td>', 'I''m not a big fan of HDR, but this works for me. There is a metallic quality to this image that reminds me of some artists who attempt photo realistic images with paints, chalk, etc. I don''t think the image is quite up to the same level as some others, but it is an interesting image. There are a few minor technical issues like color changes along the arm pit and under the chin, but other than that - not much to complain about.', '2012-02-29 11:30:20.000000', NULL, 1),
