(6695440, 1001381, 101256, '<td valign="top">Well it certainly is a different take on the subject - sort of "outside the box" if you will. Having said that, there really isn''t much to say - more like a snap shot rather than a composition - not that there is anything wrong with that.</td>', 'Well it certainly is a different take on the subject - sort of "outside the box" if you will. Having said that, there really isn''t much to say - more like a snap shot rather than a composition - not that there is anything wrong with that.', '2012-02-29 16:14:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6695445, 1001027, 101256, '<td valign="top">Too much white, too busy a foreground, not enough detail on the snow boarder. Could have used a little more thought in composing the image or a longer lens to pickup the detail of the subject.  Color might have worked better here.</td>', 'Too much white, too busy a foreground, not enough detail on the snow boarder. Could have used a little more thought in composing the image or a longer lens to pickup the detail of the subject.  Color might have worked better here.', '2012-02-29 16:15:56.000000', NULL, 1),
