(6695457, 1001534, 101256, '<td valign="top">Ach - six times I''ve looked at this image - I like it, then I don''t like it. The sepia looks good, then it doesn''t. Detail is outstanding, the composition is good - maybe it''s the fact that street art is usually colorful and bold and this isn''t.  I can''t explain it.  So having said that, error on the side of the author I always say.</td>', 'Ach - six times I''ve looked at this image - I like it, then I don''t like it. The sepia looks good, then it doesn''t. Detail is outstanding, the composition is good - maybe it''s the fact that street art is usually colorful and bold and this isn''t.  I can''t explain it.  So having said that, error on the side of the author I always say.', '2012-02-29 16:19:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6695469, 1000932, 101256, '<td valign="top">Very clean image - the background is very interesting with that slight grain effect and the sharper foreground. The overall tonality could be a little more contrasty, but it still works.</td>', 'Very clean image - the background is very interesting with that slight grain effect and the sharper foreground. The overall tonality could be a little more contrasty, but it still works.', '2012-02-29 16:24:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6695472, 1001052, 101256, '<td valign="top">I''ve looked at this several times and can''t decide if the problem is the color or the image is slightly out of focus. A closer look at one aspect of this wreck or maybe a broader look would have been better. Certainly a little sharper focus would have helped.</td>', 'I''ve looked at this several times and can''t decide if the problem is the color or the image is slightly out of focus. A closer look at one aspect of this wreck or maybe a broader look would have been better. Certainly a little sharper focus would have helped.', '2012-02-29 16:27:05.000000', NULL, 1),
