(6696047, 1001182, 114285, '<td valign="top">ROFL.</td>', 'ROFL.', '2012-03-01 02:57:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6696049, 1000975, 114285, '<td valign="top">I had a few of these bucket shots in a row, this is by far the best.</td>', 'I had a few of these bucket shots in a row, this is by far the best.', '2012-03-01 02:59:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6696051, 1001534, 114285, '<td valign="top">Oh dear typo, but i suppose someone has already spelled that out to you, still great shot.</td>', 'Oh dear typo, but i suppose someone has already spelled that out to you, still great shot.', '2012-03-01 03:01:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6696203, 1000825, 27812, '<td valign="top">Nice interpretation! 8</td>', 'Nice interpretation! 8', '2012-03-01 05:38:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6696333, 1001454, 118154, '<td valign="top">Daisies ? wot daisies. Not a bad shot by the way.</td>', 'Daisies ? wot daisies. Not a bad shot by the way.', '2012-03-01 07:58:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6696391, 1001461, 101256, '<td valign="top">This might have worked a little better if more of the sunset was in the shot and a little closer look at the chopper.</td>', 'This might have worked a little better if more of the sunset was in the shot and a little closer look at the chopper.', '2012-03-01 08:22:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6696392, 1000542, 101256, '<td valign="top">There is a lot in this image if you care to interpret it.  The rather vague focus, high grain, stark contrast - it is a very artsy shot and probably won''t get a very high rating, but it''s more complex from an interpretive POV than a technical POV.</td>', 'There is a lot in this image if you care to interpret it.  The rather vague focus, high grain, stark contrast - it is a very artsy shot and probably won''t get a very high rating, but it''s more complex from an interpretive POV than a technical POV.', '2012-03-01 08:24:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6696402, 1001245, 101256, '<td valign="top">Just a comment if you will, but I wonder if the author tried a landscape capture also? A longer, deeper shot of the light - then again, that''s what I might have tried so ignore that comment if you want. I like it - the transition from dark to light is smooth, the intent of the image is clear and from a technical standpoint, nothing much to complain about.</td>', 'Just a comment if you will, but I wonder if the author tried a landscape capture also? A longer, deeper shot of the light - then again, that''s what I might have tried so ignore that comment if you want. I like it - the transition from dark to light is smooth, the intent of the image is clear and from a technical standpoint, nothing much to complain about.', '2012-03-01 08:29:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6696407, 1000538, 101256, '<td valign="top">I was once in a water supply tunnel and actually had a view like this at one point because my glasses had fogged over from the change in humidity. So I''m giving this one high marks if only for that reason.</td>', 'I was once in a water supply tunnel and actually had a view like this at one point because my glasses had fogged over from the change in humidity. So I''m giving this one high marks if only for that reason.', '2012-03-01 08:32:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6696411, 1000825, 101256, '<td valign="top">Gone or Going? There is an interesting almost HDR transition from left to right in this that is pretty unique. A worthy entry into the challenge.</td>', 'Gone or Going? There is an interesting almost HDR transition from left to right in this that is pretty unique. A worthy entry into the challenge.', '2012-03-01 08:34:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6696415, 1001574, 101256, '<td valign="top">Yeah - we get it.</td>', 'Yeah - we get it.', '2012-03-01 08:35:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6696418, 1001081, 101256, '<td valign="top">Well I''ll be darned - Zombie!  Interesting concept.</td>', 'Well I''ll be darned - Zombie!  Interesting concept.', '2012-03-01 08:36:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6696422, 1000690, 101256, '<td valign="top">Wow - I''ve been in that exact same spot and I think with the exact same busker. Huh.  I like it - the slight green cast to the image enhances rather than detracts from the overall impact.</td>', 'Wow - I''ve been in that exact same spot and I think with the exact same busker. Huh.  I like it - the slight green cast to the image enhances rather than detracts from the overall impact.', '2012-03-01 08:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6696423, 1001423, 101256, '<td valign="top">This gets high marks just because it is different and unique. Well done.</td>', 'This gets high marks just because it is different and unique. Well done.', '2012-03-01 08:40:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6696424, 1000842, 101256, '<td valign="top">This would be a great image for a character study. It looks like a candid and technically very good. There is a lot of living in that face - a history that begs to be told. Nice capture - well done. I''m not exactly sure how this is a euphemism but then again, not all images in this challenge were.</td>', 'This would be a great image for a character study. It looks like a candid and technically very good. There is a lot of living in that face - a history that begs to be told. Nice capture - well done. I''m not exactly sure how this is a euphemism but then again, not all images in this challenge were.', '2012-03-01 08:42:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6696428, 1001454, 101256, '<td valign="top">Well, not to nit pick, but those are dandelions, not daisies but I take your point.  I picked up on the bee immediately and wonder if that was intentional - cycle of life and all that stuff? Certainly meets the challenge criteria.<br/> <br/>UPDATE: Turns out that a dandelion is a member of the Asteraceae family which - ahem - is a daisy. My apologies. :&gt;)</td>', 'Well, not to nit pick, but those are dandelions, not daisies but I take your point.  I picked up on the bee immediately and wonder if that was intentional - cycle of life and all that stuff? Certainly meets the challenge criteria. UPDATE: Turns out that a dandelion is a member of the Asteraceae family which - ahem - is a daisy. My apologies. :>)', '2012-03-01 08:50:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6696429, 1001440, 101256, '<td valign="top">This might have worked better is there was some context to the image. I get the point - not sure others would.</td>', 'This might have worked better is there was some context to the image. I get the point - not sure others would.', '2012-03-01 08:51:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6696432, 1001565, 101256, '<td valign="top">Needs a little more context - like maybe an actual message.  The gray scale is a little washed out - there''s nothing to really bounce an opinion off of.</td>', 'Needs a little more context - like maybe an actual message.  The gray scale is a little washed out - there''s nothing to really bounce an opinion off of.', '2012-03-01 08:52:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6696448, 1001550, 101256, '<td valign="top">I like this a lot - vaguely spooky, almost in a Grimm''s Fairy Tale kind of way. Its the kind of image that would work as a stock shot for Halloween. Good solid entry.</td>', 'I like this a lot - vaguely spooky, almost in a Grimm''s Fairy Tale kind of way. Its the kind of image that would work as a stock shot for Halloween. Good solid entry.', '2012-03-01 09:09:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6696451, 1001469, 101256, '<td valign="top">I''ll be honest - I''ve come back to this eight times and I love it, then hate it, then I''m Meh about it.  When in doubt, give the best mark you can I always say. :&gt;)</td>', 'I''ll be honest - I''ve come back to this eight times and I love it, then hate it, then I''m Meh about it.  When in doubt, give the best mark you can I always say. :>)', '2012-03-01 09:11:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6696453, 1001395, 101256, '<td valign="top">I figured there would be a lot of entries in this "pushing up daisies" category, but there are only two - interesting. Anyway, I like this although in my opinion (which, according to my spouse doesn''t count) the color, black/white technique is over done.  But it works here - nicely done.</td>', 'I figured there would be a lot of entries in this "pushing up daisies" category, but there are only two - interesting. Anyway, I like this although in my opinion (which, according to my spouse doesn''t count) the color, black/white technique is over done.  But it works here - nicely done.', '2012-03-01 09:12:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6696454, 1001543, 101256, '<td valign="top">This should place very high - excellent composition as the image gets the point across very effectively.  Well done.</td>', 'This should place very high - excellent composition as the image gets the point across very effectively.  Well done.', '2012-03-01 09:14:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6696455, 1001530, 101256, '<td valign="top">Clever and cute, but not quite up to the standard set by the other kick the bucket images. Great idea but it needed a little more work in the composition department.</td>', 'Clever and cute, but not quite up to the standard set by the other kick the bucket images. Great idea but it needed a little more work in the composition department.', '2012-03-01 09:15:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6696456, 1001573, 101256, '<td valign="top">There just isn''t much to say about this image other than it is very well composed and gets the point across.  I would think this should place rather high - certainly top ten.</td>', 'There just isn''t much to say about this image other than it is very well composed and gets the point across.  I would think this should place rather high - certainly top ten.', '2012-03-01 09:17:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6696457, 1001361, 101256, '<td valign="top">Been there, done that. Gets the point across very effectively. Should place high.</td>', 'Been there, done that. Gets the point across very effectively. Should place high.', '2012-03-01 09:18:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6696459, 1001380, 101256, '<td valign="top">It is a crisp image and imparts a sense of depth and dimension which helps it a lot. Just a tad washed out in my opinion which changed it from a 9 to an 8.</td>', 'It is a crisp image and imparts a sense of depth and dimension which helps it a lot. Just a tad washed out in my opinion which changed it from a 9 to an 8.', '2012-03-01 09:20:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6696461, 1001420, 101256, '<td valign="top">Did you know that from a nutritional standpoint, a brown egg is no different than a white egg?  The reason one is brown and one is white is due to the breed of chicken - that''s it - just the breed of chicken.<br/> <br/>Which has nothing to do with the image. Very clever, excellent composition and an apropos title. I''ve changed the rating from 8 to 9 on a rethink of the overall impact of the image.</td>', 'Did you know that from a nutritional standpoint, a brown egg is no different than a white egg?  The reason one is brown and one is white is due to the breed of chicken - that''s it - just the breed of chicken. Which has nothing to do with the image. Very clever, excellent composition and an apropos title. I''ve changed the rating from 8 to 9 on a rethink of the overall impact of the image.', '2012-03-01 09:26:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6696524, 1001535, 16046, '<td valign="top">She''s hot, well played</td>', 'She''s hot, well played', '2012-03-01 10:06:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6696528, 1000932, 16046, '<td valign="top">Cute</td>', 'Cute', '2012-03-01 10:07:15.000000', NULL, 1),
