(6702533, 1001007, 49018, '<td valign="top">Great stuff, so well captured and framed.</td>', 'Great stuff, so well captured and framed.', '2012-03-07 06:09:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(6702534, 1001519, 141542, '<td valign="top">Thank you for all of the wonderful comments, and the one or two critiques in there were also very spot on.  This is my second personal best in a row, and for me that is just a wonderful accomplishment, so I thank you for your appreciation of my idea and the image that came out of it!!<br/> <br/>As for the bun, <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_N.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_N.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_N.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=96751" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">tanguera</a>, it is in her belly! haha</td>', 'Thank you for all of the wonderful comments, and the one or two critiques in there were also very spot on.  This is my second personal best in a row, and for me that is just a wonderful accomplishment, so I thank you for your appreciation of my idea and the image that came out of it!! As for the bun,  tanguera, it is in her belly! haha', '2012-03-07 06:13:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(6702540, 1000641, 49018, '<td valign="top">That''s interesting. Being ''thick'' a UK idiom for ''not too smart'' (yet another euphemism : ), I thought you might be referring to "thick as a brick" and by extension to "few bricks short of wall", which is also the favourite one liner of a British friend of mine :)<br/> <br/></td>', 'That''s interesting. Being ''thick'' a UK idiom for ''not too smart'' (yet another euphemism : ), I thought you might be referring to "thick as a brick" and by extension to "few bricks short of wall", which is also the favourite one liner of a British friend of mine :) ', '2012-03-07 06:23:50.000000', NULL, 0),
